[03/13 11:12:53     33s]     #-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[03/13 11:12:53     33s]     # The FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS is an environment variable which should be exported by
[03/13 11:12:53     33s]     # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
